# Probe: is remotejoy's screen stream safe and fast enough? ~40 s, offline.
# Before: PSPDX running, network dialog cancelled (browsing from cache),
# Options -> Show FPS on, cursor on the Homebrews tab.
mark start
wait 3.0
tap cross             # open "Game"
wait 1.5
taps down 3
tap cross             # an app page: its ICON1 preview must keep playing
mark page
wait 12.0
tap circle
mark scroll
hold down 4.0         # scrolling under capture: watch the FPS counter
mark idle
wait 15.0             # "Filling cache" + previews while streaming
